---
import Layout from '../../layouts/UndergroundLayout.astro';
import Inquiry from '../../components/AgencyInquiry.astro';
import {agency} from '../../data/agency';
---
<Layout title="Start a project — WebDECOR" active="start" description="Prepare a WebDECOR project brief to email or download. Review and send the draft in your email app."><section class="u-page-cover u-brief-cover" data-window="Brief.txt / New project"><span class="u-meta">03 / PROJECT INTAKE</span><h1>BRIEF<span class="u-hand-note">from idea<br/>to interface.</span></h1><h2>What do you<br/>have in mind?</h2><p>Bring the ambition, the unfinished idea, or the website that needs a new chapter. Let’s give it a starting point.</p></section><section class="u-brief-body u-editorial-section" aria-label="Build a project brief" data-window="Brief.txt / Project intake"><aside><span class="u-meta">PROJECT / WORKING DOCUMENT</span><h2>A little context.<br/>A clearer direction.</h2><p>You don’t need a finished plan. Capture the essentials before defining the scope.</p><ol><li>Identity <small>You and your organisation</small></li><li>Ambition <small>The audience and the goal</small></li><li>Scope <small>The package and priorities</small></li><li>Next chapter <small>The timing and budget</small></li></ol><span class="u-meta">OUTPUT / EMAIL DRAFT + .TXT</span><p>{agency.email ? 'Open a draft in your email app, review it, and send it there. You can also download a text copy to keep or share.' : 'Download a text copy to keep, edit, and share.'}</p><p>This tool runs locally in your browser. Nothing is submitted through this website.</p></aside><Inquiry email={agency.email} bookingUrl={agency.bookingUrl} services={agency.services} pricing={agency.pricing} brand={agency.name}/></section></Layout>
